with stunning visual effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818180/extras/20215eb383ffd1349602a4fb7ea38a6e.poster.avif?t=1729680552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818180/extras/20215eb383ffd1349602a4fb7ea38a6e.webm?t=1729680552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818180/extras/20215eb383ffd1349602a4fb7ea38a6e.mp4?t=1729680552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818180/extras/b58f26c3092d6625ea44269c5ffbf9b1.webp?t=1729680552\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need fast access to an item or a fully built world? Simply download from the Steam Workshop and have it in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assets created in game can be shared with others- this includes maps, characters, special items, and player sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We believe in sharing and growing our creations as a community, as such, workshop sharing will always remain free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818180/extras/07191dfd78738a79dd5c128c3e6f9d29.poster.avif?t=1729680552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818180/extras/07191dfd78738a79dd5c128c3e6f9d29.webm?t=1729680552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818180/extras/07191dfd78738a79dd5c128c3e6f9d29.mp4?t=1729680552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beyond TTR